# Prettier ignores for repo-root runs (the `Check Prettier formatting (repo
# markdown)` CI step). Frontend-scoped runs use `frontend/.prettierignore`.
#
# Prettier honors the root `.gitignore` by default, so node_modules/, dist/,
# build/, coverage/, private/, .superpowers/, and docs/superpowers/ are already
# excluded and are not repeated here.

# Design-system reference export (kept as-is; not maintained app source).
# Mirrors the `design` entry in frontend/.prettierignore — without this, a
# root-level run would reformat files that are deliberately frozen.
frontend/design
